Package: panoramic
Title: Variance-Aware Multi-Sample Spatial Colocalization Analysis
Version: 0.99.4
Authors@R: person("Jacob", "Chang", email = "jachang4@stanford.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "fnd"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3719-7949"))
Description: Quantifies and compares cell-type spatial colocalization
    across samples, patients, and conditions in spatial omics studies.
    Its primary statistic, edge-corrected local competition enrichment,
    measures excess or deficit local mixing for ordered cell-type pairs on a
    percentage-point scale. The package estimates within-sample uncertainty
    with spatial bootstrap procedures and propagates it through multilevel
    random-effects meta-analysis for pooled inference and group-level
    contrasts; classical spatial summary statistics are also supported.
URL: https://github.com/plevritis-lab/panoramic
BugReports: https://github.com/plevritis-lab/panoramic/issues    
